Dear Craig Jacobs,

Thank you for supporting Cederberg Office Supplies. Here is our October 2026 newsletter for Bay Dental Rooms and our other valued customers.

Product news: We have added recycled A4 paper boxes, refillable whiteboard markers and ergonomic desk chairs to our regular range. Samples are available in store and our team can help with bulk orders for the year end.

Seasonal tip: With warmer weather on the way, check your office ventilation and store paper away from direct sunlight to prevent curling. A quick tidy of the stationery cupboard now saves time later.

If you have any questions, reply to this email or visit us in store. Pieter Malan and the team appreciate your support.

